;
HETEROGEN
THERE IS AN EXTRA ATOM H22 IN MOLECULE 7IP. AUTHOR STATES
THAT THE MOLECULE 7IP IS PROTONATED (CHARGED) UNDER THE
PH CONDITIONS OF THE EXPERIMENT, AND THIS PROTONATION
STATE IS CRITICAL TO THE BINDING MODE OBSERVED.
